  "details": "Hello.\n\nBefore PhysBones, Dynamic Bones had a friction feature that prevented bones from slipping around colliders.\n\nThis is crucial for preventing hair from slipping around the torso or skirts from slipping around legs too easily, or letting bones rest on your hands, just to cite a few examples.\n\nIs PhysBone friction currently planned for development as of 2025?\n\nTwo threads have been asking about this subject since 2022, without a proper answer. Letting creators know the answer once and for all would help a lot!",
